Verse 12
Though I cannot explain all the fullness of God,
How He sent His own Son to suffer and die,
Though for man theres no way to the Kingdom of God
By his own helpless power or deed,
Still I know it is true, He can reach even you,
For He reached even me.

Verse 13
(Refrain)
Even me, with all my brokenness and pride,
Even me, though my soul was torn apart inside,
Yes, I am sure that Gods infinite love
Is all that they say it will be.
In the midst of the night, Jesus sent out the Light
That reached even me even me.

Verse 14
Though your eyes have no sight of the glories of heaven,
Though your heart remain hard to the hope God has given,
I will not see despair as I lift you in prayer
Til my earthly life ceases to be,
For I know it is true, all that Gods love can do,
For He saved even me.

Verse 15
(Repeat Refrain)
